  "bodyHash": "4f175a35d81c860e",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/30b62acab7a3933953e7f112b7ea0019a0ffd6b9.png\" width=\"711\" height=\"261\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cf801a8621ad1dfafb9b3c752f15b67273b63b65.webp\" width=\"554\" height=\"43\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>注意：仅 1.20.1 及更高版本将保持更新。</strong></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800080\">关于</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">该模组作为《Cracker's Wither Storm Mod》的附加组件，并融入了其原创音乐。它将使用艺术家 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Vertigo_Music/featured\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vertigo</a> 创作的自定义曲目，取代模组的默认音乐。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>重要提示：与 CWSM 默认音乐一样，所有通过此模组添加的曲目音量均可通过菜单中的“选项 > 音乐与声音”下的“留声机/音符盒”滑块进行调整。</strong></span><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:8px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#936\">配置文件夹：</span> config/CWSM V-Sides; Common.toml</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可配置的内容：</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">启用或禁用模组中的任意曲目（包含一个禁用整个原声带的选项）</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">是否默认启用字幕</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">凋灵风暴是否会掉落凋灵收音机</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">禁用每次首次进入世界时显示的提示信息</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#669\">当满足以下条件时会播放独占音乐（按通常触发顺序排列）：</span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><br></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&bull;&nbsp; 玩家附近 100 格内有凋灵风暴（阶段 1-3），若玩家下潜至地下 14 格则停止播放</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&bull;&nbsp; 玩家附近 230 格内有凋灵风暴（阶段 4-5），若玩家下潜至地下 14 格则停止播放</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&bull;&nbsp; 玩家附近 69 格内有共生体</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&bull;&nbsp; 玩家附近 88 格内有被击倒的凋灵风暴（复活时也适用）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&bull;&nbsp; 玩家附近 350 格内有凋灵风暴（阶段 6-7），若玩家下潜至地下 14 格则停止播放</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&bull;&nbsp; 玩家在幽暗深处时</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&bull;&nbsp; 与命令方块发起战斗时，每个阶段有 3 首独立曲目</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&bull;&nbsp; 凋灵风暴最终从世界中被击败后</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#c9f\">凋灵收音机</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#c9f\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:14px\">击败凋灵风暴后获得，可随时聆听风暴狂暴期间播放的所有曲目，以及原本在默认生存游戏中不会听到的未使用/独占版本曲目。</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#c9f\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:14px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GDthJj5eLp0?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#669\">模组内所有曲目列表（按典型播放顺序）：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/W0yfu0ksVpY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/umCQV1Vxq1w?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kFI9IPHXQpw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Zx2O9I7Oo7E?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uJnF7ZUmQHQ?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/s_sSW9QulE4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-nNrDxm-Qys?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#669\">模组包含的其他功能：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&bull;&nbsp; 根据当前播放的歌曲，屏幕底部中央会在短暂时间内显示一条提示，注明正在播放的具体曲目。<strong>玩家也可以通过输入命令序列 <em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">/cwsmvsides.enable.subtitles (true/false)</span></em> 来自由切换此功能！</strong><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/075adfb35fc91b9de33c5c4f7bd03ba93f9c9951.png\" width=\"539\" height=\"280\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&bull;&nbsp> 可随时通过<strong><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">/cwsmvsides.enable (true/false)</span></em>命令切换原声带播放状态<br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cd2196cb6a65c7fa795f3ace69bdf2eea7ef623c.png\" width=\"389\" height=\"104\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">(注：每次首次进入世界时会弹出提示消息说明此情况。)</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">\"音乐仅在 Boss 生成时播放\"</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你可能安装了<strong>Dynamic Surroundings</strong>。无需卸载模组，请按以下步骤完全解决此问题，同时保留 Dynamic Surroundings 安装：<br><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1T0fpHUYm9zE_luBFx0mNjUFQxZxxc6drXSR_lBbBJCc/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1T0fpHUYm9zE_luBFx0mNjUFQxZxxc6drXSR_lBbBJCc/edit?usp=sharing</a></span></p>\n</div>",
